  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. **The Show**: Your partner privately shows you one of their face-down cards. You now know its identity and position. 2. **The Guess**: You must guess the identity of one of your OPPONENTS' face-down cards (Position + Rank). 3. **The Reveal**: If correct: The opponent turns the card face-up permanently. If incorrect: YOU must choose one of your own face-down cards to reveal face-up. 4. **Winning Declaration**: A player can 'Declare' at any time. They must correctly identify EVERY remaining face-down card in the game (teammates and opponents). If they get even one wrong, their team loses immediately.",
    Player: "1. **The Show**: Your partner privately shows you one of their face-down cards. You now know its identity and position. 2. **The Guess**: You must guess the identity of one of your OPPONENTS' face-down cards (Position + Rank). 3. **The Reveal**: If correct: The opponent turns the card face-up permanently. If incorrect: YOU must choose one of your own face-down cards to reveal face-up. 4. **Winning Declaration**: A player can 'Declare' at any time. They must correctly identify EVERY remaining face-down card in the game (teammates and opponents). If they get even one wrong, their team loses immediately.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to correctly declare the identities of all cards still in play.',
    gameplay: "1. **The Show**: Your partner privately shows you one of their face-down cards. You now know its identity and position. 2. **The Guess**: You must guess the identity of one of your OPPONENTS' face-down cards (Position + Rank). 3. **The Reveal**: If correct: The opponent turns the card face-up permanently. If incorrect: YOU must choose one of your own face-down cards to reveal face-up. 4. **Winning Declaration**: A player can 'Declare' at any time. They must correctly identify EVERY remaining face-down card in the game (teammates and opponents). If they get even one wrong, their team loses immediately.",
    keyRules: [
      'Cards arranged in ascending order left to right.',
      'Partner shows you one card (identity and position).',
      "Guess opponent's card by position and rank.",
      'Correct guess: opponent reveals that card.',
      'Incorrect guess: you must reveal one of your own cards.',
      'Can declare at any time to name all remaining face-down cards.',
      'Declaration must be 100% correct or your team loses.',
