    turnFlow: "1. **The Show**: Your partner privately shows you one of their face-down cards. You now know its identity and position. 2. **The Guess**: You must guess the identity of one of your OPPONENTS' face-down cards (Position + Rank). 3. **The Reveal**: If correct: The opponent turns the card face-up permanently. If incorrect: YOU must choose one of your own face-down cards to reveal face-up. 4. **Winning Declaration**: A player can 'Declare' at any time. They must correctly identify EVERY remaining face-down card in the game (teammates and opponents). If they get even one wrong, their team loses immediately.",
